OL,3,APlane may have broken apart ahead of
OL,4,Adeadly Florida jet crash, say
OL,5,Ainvestigators
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US National Transportation Safety
OL,8,FBoard (NTSB) says it will investigate
OL,9,Fwhether parts of a jet that crashed in
OL,10,FFlorida broke off before it nose-dived
OL,11,Fand exploded, killing all nine people
OL,12,Fon board.
OL,14,FThe Learjet 60, which was travelling
OL,15,Ffrom Austin, Texas to the Bahamas on
OL,16,FSunday, crashed on a street nine miles
OL,17,F(14 km) from President Donald Trump's
OL,18,FMar-a-Lago resort.
OL,20,FA tech entrepreneur and his young
OL,21,Ffamily, as well as the 20-year-old
OL,22,Fcopilot, were among those who died.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
