OL,4,Adeadly Florida jet crash, say
OL,5,Ainvestigators
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe NTSB said on Monday that it would
OL,8,Falso investigate to what extent ice and
OL,9,Fturbulence may have been contributing
OL,10,Ffactors.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
